\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-sm-4">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<mat-form-field>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input test-id="traineeLoginName" matInput name="traineeLoginName" [(ngModel)]="traineeLoginName" type="text"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   placeholder="Search by username, Salesforce contact ID, or technician ID" c4Focus>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</mat-form-field>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-sm-2">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<button test-id="searchTraineeClick" type="submit" [disabled]="(!traineeLoginName || traineeLoading)" class="c4btn block"><i\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   class="fal {{traineeLoading ? \'fa-sync fa-spin\' : \'fa-sync\'}}"></i>{{traineeLoading ? \'Loading...\' : \'Search\'}}</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-sm-2">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<button test-id="clearTraineeClick" type="button" (click)="trainee = null;" class="c4btn block grey"><i\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   class="fal fa-times-circle"></i>Clear</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</form>\n\t\t\t<small>Enter the <b>username</b> or <b>technician ID</b> of the trainee you are looking up in the field above.</small>\n\t\t\t<div *ngIf="trainee && trainee.errors" class="half-margin-top alert alert-warning">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class="no-style">\n\t\t\t\t\t<li *ngFor="let error of trainee.errors">{{error.errorMessage}}</li>\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div *ngIf="trainee && !trainee.errors" class="half-margin-top">\n\t\t\t\t<h3>Trainee</h3>\n\t\t\t\t<ul class="no-style">\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Name: <b>{{trainee.fullName}}</b></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Username: <b>{{trainee.userId}}</b></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Email: <b>{{trainee.email}}</b></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>AccountId: <b>{{trainee.accountId}}</b></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>OrderId: <b>{{trainee.orderId}}</b></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Portal: <b>{{traineePortalName}}</b></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Salesforce User Id: <a href="{{traineeSalesforceUserUrl}}"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t   target="_blank"><b>{{trainee.salesforceUserId}}</b></a></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Salesforce Contact Id: <a href="{{traineeSalesforceContactUrl}}"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t   target="_blank"><b>{{trainee.salesforceContactId}}</b></a></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Technician Id: <b>{{trainee.technicianId}}</b></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>User Creation Date: <b>{{trainee.creationDate | date:\'MM/dd/yyyy h:mma\'}}</b></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Last Visit Date: <b>{{trainee.lastVisitDate | date:\'MM/dd/yyyy h:mma\'}}</b></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Registered Start Date: <b>{{trainee.rebateStartDate | date:\'MM/dd/yyyy h:mma\'}}</b></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li *ngIf="trainee.currentStatus === 50">Completion Date: <b>{{trainee.completionDate | date:\'MM/dd/yyyy h:mma\'}}</b></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Certification Status: <b>{{getCertificationStatus(trainee.currentStatus)}}</b></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>PCNA Type: <b>{{getPCNATypePrettyName(trainee.pcnaType)}}</b></li>\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class="half-margin-top" *ngIf="trainee?.examPartOne">\n\t\t\t\t<h3>Exams</h3>\n\t\t\t\t<ul class="no-style half-margin-bottom">\n\t\t\t\t\t<li><b>{{trainee.examPartOne.name}}</b></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Completed: {{trainee.examPartOne.completed}}</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li *ngIf="trainee.examPartOne.completedDate">Completed Date: {{trainee.examPartOne.completedDate | date:\'MM/dd/yyyy h:mma\'}}</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Passed: {{trainee.examPartOne.passed}}</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Status: {{trainee.examPartOne.status}}</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Score: {{trainee.examPartOne.score}}</li>\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class="half-margin-top" *ngIf="trainee?.examPartTwo">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class="no-style half-margin-bottom">\n\t\t\t\t\t<li><b>{{trainee.examPartTwo.name}}</b></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Completed: {{trainee.examPartTwo.completed}}</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li *ngIf="trainee.examPartTwo.completedDate">Completed Date: {{trainee.examPartTwo.completedDate | date:\'MM/dd/yyyy h:mma\'}}</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Passed: {{trainee.examPartTwo.passed}}</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Status: {{trainee.examPartTwo.status}}</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Score: {{trainee.examPartTwo.score}}</li>\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class="half-margin-top" *ngIf="trainee?.courses?.length > 0">\n\t\t\t\t<h3>Courses</h3>\n\t\t\t\t<ul class="no-style half-margin-bottom" *ngFor="let course of trainee.courses">\n\t\t\t\t\t<li><b>{{course.name}}</b></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Score: {{course.score}}</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Status: {{course.status}}</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Passed: {{course.passed}}</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Completed: {{course.completed}}</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li *ngIf="course.completedDate">Completed Date: {{course.completedDate | date:\'MM/dd/yyyy h:mma\'}} </li>\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class="widget">\n\t\t<div class="padding">\n\t\t\t<h3 class="half-margin-bottom">Update Salesforce Contact Id</h3>\n\t\t\t<form (submit)="updateUserSalesforceInfo()">\n\t\t\t\t<div class="row">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-sm-3">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<mat-form-field>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input test-id="updateLoginName" name="updateLoginName" matInput [(ngModel)]="updateLoginName" type="text"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   placeholder="Username of Trainee">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</mat-form-field>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-sm-3">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<mat-form-field>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input test-id="salesforceContactId" name="salesforceContactId" matInput [(ngModel)]="salesforceContactId" type="text"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   placeholder="New Salesforce Contact Id">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</mat-form-field>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-sm-3">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<mat-form-field>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input test-id="salesforceUserId" name="salesforceUserId" matInput [(ngModel)]="salesforceUserId" type="text"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   placeholder="New Salesforce User Id">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</mat-form-field>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-sm-3">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<button test-id="updateUserSalesforceInfoClick" type="submit" [disabled]="(!updateLoginName || updateLoading)" class="c4btn block"><i\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   class="fal {{updateLoading ? \'fa-sync fa-spin\' : \'fa-sync\'}}"></i>Update</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</form>\n\t\t\t<small>Enter the <b>username</b> of the trainee and the desired <b>Salesforce Contact Id</b> and/or <b>Salesforce User Id</b> in the fields\n\t\t\t\tabove.<br /><b>Note:</b> A blank field will result no changes for the trainee. </small>\n\t\t\t<div *ngIf="updateTrainee && !updateTrainee.success" class="half-margin-top alert alert-warning"> {{updateTrainee.errorMessage}} </div>\n\t\t\t<div *ngIf="updateTrainee && updateTrainee.success" class="half-margin-top alert alert-success">\n\t\t\t\t<b>Success!</b> {{updateMessage}}\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class="widget">\n\t\t<div class="padding">\n\t\t\t<h3 class="half-margin-bottom">PCNA Rebate Timer Reset</h3>\n\t\t\t<form (submit)="resetRebate()">\n\t\t\t\t<div class="row">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-sm-4">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<mat-form-field>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input test-id="rebateLoginName" name="rebateLoginName" matInput [(ngModel)]="rebateLoginName" type="text"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   placeholder="Username of Trainee">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</mat-form-field>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-sm-4">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<input test-id="rebateDate" name="rebateDate" [(ngModel)]="rebateDate" type="date"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   placeholder="Date of Registration">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-sm-2">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<button test-id="rebateTimerResetClick" type="submit" [disabled]="(!rebateLoginName || rebateLoading)" class="c4btn block"><i\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   class="fal {{rebateLoading ? \'fa-plane-alt fa-spin\' : \'fa-sync\'}}"></i>{{rebateLoading ? \'PEW PEW!!\' : \'Reset\'}}</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-sm-2">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<button test-id="clearRebateTraineeClick" type="button" (click)="rebateTrainee = null;" class="c4btn block grey"><i\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   class="fal fa-times-circle"></i>Clear</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</form>\n\t\t\t<small>Enter the <b>username</b> of the trainee and the desired <b>rebate start date</b> in the fields above.</small>\n\t\t\t<div *ngIf="rebateTrainee && !rebateTrainee.success" class="half-margin-top alert alert-warning">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class="no-style">\n\t\t\t\t\t<li *ngFor="let error of rebateTrainee.errors">{{error.errorMessage}}</li>\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div *ngIf="rebateTrainee && rebateTrainee.success" class="half-margin-top alert alert-success"\n\t\t\t\t [innerHTML]="rebateResetMessage | safeHtml">\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class="widget">\n\t\t<div class="padding">\n\t\t\t<h3 class="half-margin-bottom">Transfer PCNA Kit</h3>\n\t\t\t<form (submit)="transferPcnaKit()">\n\t\t\t\t<div class="row">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-sm-4">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<mat-form-field>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input test-id="fromLoginName" matInput name="fromLoginName" [(ngModel)]="fromLoginName" type="text"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   placeholder="Transfer From">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</mat-form-field>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-sm-4">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<mat-form-field>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input test-id="toLoginName" matInput name="toLoginName" [(ngModel)]="toLoginName" type="text"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   placeholder="Transfer To">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</mat-form-field>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-sm-4">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<button test-id="transferPcnaKitClick" type="submit" [disabled]="(!fromLoginName || !toLoginName || loading)"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass="c4btn block"><i class="fal {{loading ? \'fa-plane-alt fa-spin\' : \'fa-sync\'}}"></i>{{loading ? \'PEW PEW!!\' :\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\'Transfer\'}}</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</form>\n\t\t\t<small>Enter the <b>usernames</b> of the users you are transferring from and transferring to in the fields above.</small>\n\t\t\t<div *ngIf="transferResult">\n\t\t\t\t<div id="pcna-alert" *ngIf="!transferResult.success" class="half-margin-top alert alert-warning">\n\t\t\t\t\t<ul class="no-style">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li *ngFor="let error of transferResult.errors">{{error.errorMessage}}</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div id="pcna-success" *ngIf="transferResult.success" class="half-margin-top alert alert-success"\n\t\t\t\t\t [innerHTML]="transferMessage | safeHtml">\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div id="{{transferResult.success ? \'ted-success\' : \'ted-failure\'}}" *ngIf="transferResult"></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class="widget">\n\t\t<div class="padding">\n\t\t\t<h3 class="half-margin-bottom">Register User for PCNA</h3>\n\t\t\t<form (submit)="registerUserForPcna()">\n\t\t\t\t<div class="row">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-sm-4">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<mat-form-field>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input test-id="userToRegister" matInput name="userToRegister" [(ngModel)]="userToRegister" type="text"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   placeholder="User to Register for PCNA">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</mat-form-field>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-sm-3">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<select test-id="selectedPcnaType" id="pcna-type-select" name="pcnatype" [(ngModel)]="selectedPCNAType">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option disabled [value]="undefined">Select PCNA Type</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option ngValue="1">Pakedge</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option ngValue="2">Araknis</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option [ngValue]="null">Old PCNA Kit</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</select>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-sm-2">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<button test-id="registerUserForPcnaClick" type="submit" class="c4btn block grey"><i\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   class="fal fa-check-circle"></i>Register</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</form>\n\t\t\t<small>Enter the <b>username</b> of the user you want to register for PCNA.</small>\n\t\t\t<div *ngIf="userRegistrationResult">\n\t\t\t\t<div id="pcna-alert" *ngIf="!userRegistrationResult.success" class="half-margin-top alert alert-warning">\n\t\t\t\t\t<ul class="no-style">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li *ngFor="let error of userRegistrationResult.errors">{{error.errorMessage}}</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div id="pcna-success" *ngIf="userRegistrationResult.success" class="half-margin-top alert alert-success"\n\t\t\t\t\t [innerHTML]="registerForPcnaMessage | safeHtml">\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div id="{{userRegistrationResult.success ? \'ted-success\' : \'ted-failure\'}}" *ngIf="userRegistrationResult"></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class="widget">\n\t\t<div class="padding">\n\t\t\t<h3 class="half-margin-bottom">Unregister User for PCNA</h3>\n\t\t\t<form (submit)="unregisterUserForPcnaLearningPath()">\n\t\t\t\t<div class="row">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-sm-4">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<mat-form-field>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input test-id="userToUnregister" matInput name="userToUnregister" [(ngModel)]="userToUnregister" type="text"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   placeholder="User to Unregister for PCNA" required>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</mat-form-field>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-sm-3">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<select test-id="selectedPcnaType" id="pcna-type-select" name="pcnatype" [(ngModel)]="selectedPCNATypeForUnregister" required>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option disabled [value]="undefined">Select PCNA Type</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option ngValue="1">Pakedge</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option ngValue="2">Araknis</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option [ngValue]="null">Old PCNA Kit</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</select>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-sm-2">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<button test-id="unregisterUserForPcnaClick" type="submit" [disabled]="unregisterLoading" class="c4btn block grey"><i\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   class="fal fa-check-circle"></i>Unregister</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</form>\n\t\t\t<small>Enter the <b>username</b> of the user you want to unregister for PCNA.</small>\n\t\t\t<br />\n\t\t\t<small><b>Important!</b> Keep in mind that after you unregister, you will see a link below that takes you to the LearnUpon Admin Portal where you\n\t\t\t\tcan unassign the user from the Learning Path. There is currently no support in the LearnUpon API to unenroll from a Learning Path.</small>\n\t\t\t<br />\n\t\t\t<div *ngIf="unregisterUserForPcnaLearningPathUrl" class="col-sm-6">\n\t\t\t\t<div class="alert alert-info">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p><b>Important!</b> Use the following steps to complete unregistering the user from the Learning Plan and all PCNA Courses in LearnUpon.\n\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Steps</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<ol>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>First, use the following link to manually unassign user from Learning Plan.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><a href="{{unregisterUserForPcnaLearningPathUrl}}"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   target="_blank">{{unregisterUserForPcnaLearningPathUrl}}</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/control4/image/upload/v1658864139/pcna-unassign.png" alt="Unassign Learning Path" />\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style="margin-top: 10px;">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>After you have unassigned from the Learning Plan. It will appear like they are still enrolled in some of the PCNA courses. Simply\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\trefresh your page in the LearnUpon Admin portal to verify they are actually unenrolled.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<button\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass="btn btn-primary" (click)="unregisterUserForPcnaCourses()" [disabled]="unenrollCoursesLoading"><i\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   class="fal {{unenrollCoursesLoading ? \'fa-undo fa-spin\' : \'fa-undo\'}}"></i>Unenroll</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t</ol>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div style="margin-top:20px;" *ngIf="unregisterForPcnaMessage">\n\t\t\t\t<div class="alert alert-warning">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>{{unregisterForPcnaMessage}}</p>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>'}}]);